From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 13:52:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] remote_connection: enable test-support dev-deps so tests
 compile

The RemoteConnectionOptions::Mock match arms (gated on any(test, feature=
"test-support")) require the remote/project/workspace deps built with
test-support. Add the standard dev-dependency wiring (mirrors crates/project)
so 'cargo test -p remote_connection' compiles and runs without extra flags.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Cargo.lock                          | 2 ++
 crates/remote_connection/Cargo.toml | 8 +++++++-
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 903ffc45ed..6c80169c72 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -14988,8 +14988,10 @@ dependencies = [
  "log",
  "markdown",
  "menu",
+ "project",
  "release_channel",
  "remote",
+ "remote_connection",
  "semver",
  "settings",
  "theme_settings",
diff --git a/crates/remote_connection/Cargo.toml b/crates/remote_connection/Cargo.toml
index 870329f2ca..f830983237 100644
--- a/crates/remote_connection/Cargo.toml
+++ b/crates/remote_connection/Cargo.toml
@@ -30,4 +30,10 @@ settings.workspace = true
 theme_settings.workspace = true
 ui.workspace = true
 ui_input.workspace = true
-workspace.workspace = true
\ No newline at end of file
+workspace.workspace = true
+
+[dev-dependencies]
+remote = { workspace = true, features = ["test-support"] }
+project = { workspace = true, features = ["test-support"] }
+workspace = { workspace = true, features = ["test-support"] }
+remote_connection = { workspace = true, features = ["test-support"] }
\ No newline at end of file
